b0e-11ef-9966-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"馬何羅","people_name_jianti_auto":"马何罗","start_index":236,"tongjian_id":"906f3796-db0e-11ef-9f6f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"王莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"王莽","start_index":261,"tongjian_id":"906f3797-db0e-11ef-b30b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"章帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"章帝","start_index":277,"tongjian_id":"906f3798-db0e-11ef-b0a4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"郭舉","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭举","start_index":285,"tongjian_id":"906f3799-db0e-11ef-8c57-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"906f379a-db0e-11ef-82ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"906f379b-db0e-11ef-abc2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"906f379c-db0e-11ef-ac6d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西京","place_name_jianti_auto":"西京","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"906f379d-db0e-11ef-8ee3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東京","place_name_jianti_auto":"东京","start_index":153,"tongjian_id":"906f379e-db0e-11ef-9d2f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢世","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉世","start_index":220,"tongjian_id":"906f379f-db0e-11ef-b7ec-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班表，侍中僕射，秦官。自侍中、尚書郞、軍屯騶宰、永巷宦者皆有僕射。古者重武，官有主射以課督之，取其領事之號。沈約曰：侍中本秦丞相史也，使五人往來殿內東廂奏事，故謂之侍中。漢西京無員，多至數十人，入侍禁中，分掌乘輿御物，下至褻器虎子之屬。武帝世，孔安國爲侍中，以其儒者，特令掌御唾壺，朝廷榮之。久次者爲僕射。東京又屬少府，猶無員，掌侍左右贊導衆事、顧問應答；法駕出，則多識者一人負傳國璽，操斬白蛇劍參乘，餘皆騎，在乘輿車後。光武改僕射爲祭酒。漢世與中官俱止禁中。武帝時，侍中馬何羅爲逆，由是侍中出禁外，有事乃得入，事畢卽出。王莽秉政，侍中復入，與中官俱止。章帝元和中，侍中郭舉與後宮通，拔佩刀驚御。舉伏誅，侍中由是復出外。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班表，侍中仆射，秦官。自侍中、尚书郞、军屯驺宰、永巷宦者皆有仆射。古者重武，官有主射以课督之，取其领事之号。沈约曰：侍中本秦丞相史也，使五人往来殿内东厢奏事，故谓之侍中。汉西京无员，多至数十人，入侍禁中，分掌乘舆御物，下至亵器虎子之属。武帝世，孔安国为侍中，以其儒者，特令掌御唾壶，朝廷荣之。久次者为仆射。东京又属少府，犹无员，掌侍左右赞导众事、顾问应答；法驾出，则多识者一人负传国玺，操斩白蛇剑参乘，余皆骑，在乘舆车后。光武改仆射为祭酒。汉世与中官俱止禁中。武帝时，侍中马何罗为逆，由是侍中出禁外，有事乃得入，事毕即出。王莽秉政，侍中复入，与中官俱止。章帝元和中，侍中郭举与后宫通，拔佩刀惊御。举伏诛，侍中由是复出外。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"906f378f-db0e-11ef-84ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"及，謂及於禍也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"及，谓及于祸也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"906f37a1-db0e-11ef-a50b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"906f37a3-db0e-11ef-94fc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：上下於殿也。磾，丁奚翻。上，時掌翻；下廂上同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：上下于殿也。䃅，丁奚翻。上，时掌翻；下厢上同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"906f37a2-db0e-11ef-9e20-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"服虔","people_name_jianti_auto":"服虔","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"906f37a5-db0e-11ef-8f60-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"906f37a6-db0e-11ef-a556-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"胡亥","people_name_jianti_auto":"胡亥","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"906f37a7-db0e-11ef-adab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"甘泉","place_name_jianti_auto":"甘泉","place_note":"陝西淳化西北","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"906f37a8-db0e-11ef-bc03-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"林光","place_name_jianti_auto":"林光","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"906f37a9-db0e-11ef-83d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"906f37aa-db0e-11ef-8a44-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"林光宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"林光宫","start_index":18,"tongj